"""
## Purpose and audience
Purpose: Pin Chrome 159's round dots on `dotted` borders (widths 6, 8, 10, 12):
each dot is the circle inscribed in its t x t dash cell, placed by the same
dash layout as square dashed borders.
Audience: browser-engine maintainers.

Chrome 159 (arm64 headless, --force-device-scale-factor=4, --window-size=400,300;
a small window height leaves headless Chrome's capture unpainted below the
first row): the pins are every border-band pixel of the four boxes whose 4x4
device block is one colour. The anti-aliased dot edges are not pinned.
"""

"""
Traceability: REQ-BROWSER-ENGINE-DOTTED-ROUND-DOTS-CHROME159-001 — dotted borders paint round dots as Chrome 159 does.
"""
